Subject: [PATCH 2/2] issuance: add stateful sqrt tail emission (R_n^tail)
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Implements the adaptive tail from the adaptive-pow-monetary-policy paper:
  R_{n+1}^tail = clip(R_n^tail * sqrt(W_n/W_{n-1}), R_min, R_max)

- Adds Sqrt64() to util/intmath (Newton-Raphson integer floor-sqrt)
- Adds nTailSubsidy to CBlockIndex (consensus state variable, persisted)
- Adds ComputeNextTailSubsidy() — derives work ratio from nBits log2 delta
- GetBlockSubsidy() now takes CBlockIndex* and returns boot + tail
- ConnectBlock stores pindex->nTailSubsidy before validating coinbase
